  "title": "Datadog US1 - Delayed Traces in APM Trace Search",
  "text": "Service: Datadog US1\nIncident: Delayed Traces in APM Trace Search\nStatus: resolved\nImpact: major\nStarted: 2026-03-27T14:57:08.416-04:00\nResolved: 2026-03-27T15:30:04.932-04:00\nUpdates:\n- 2026-03-27T15:30:04.932-04:00: resolved - This incident has been resolved.\n- 2026-03-27T15:21:54.458-04:00: monitoring - A fix has been implemented and we are monitoring the results.\n- 2026-03-27T15:17:56.659-04:00: identified - The issue has been identified and a fix is being implemented.\n- 2026-03-27T14:57:08.500-04:00: investigating - We are investigating increased latency in processing and storing Traces in APM.\nAs a result of this issue, some users may see missing or delayed traces in APM Trace Search since 5pm UTC. They may also experience delay in APM trace-based monitors.",
